 from schools, places of worship, retail lots, restaurants, and medical institutions. Furthermore, Subang Bestari is a well-planned development and surrounded by greeneries which create a peaceful and quiet vibe.\n\n#### Subang Bestari Accessibility and Amenities\n\nWithin the matured folds of Shah Alam, the development is well-served by networks of roads and expressways such as Persiaran Atmosfera, Jalan Sungai Buloh, New Klang Valley Expressway (NKVE) and Guthrie Corridor Expressway (GCE). With these roads and expressways, the residents are blessed with convenient access to other key areas, namely Kuala Lumpur City Center, Kepong, Kota Damansara, and Petaling Jaya. As for public transportation, residents can easily commute to other major hubs via rail via Kwasa Sentral MRT Station.\n\n#### Subang Bestari Project Details\n\nSubang Bestari is a mixed-development township nestled across 500-acres leasehold land. The apartment and condominium developments available in this township include Seri Galaksi, Subang Suria, Seri Atria, Persada Condo Villa, Sri Kejora, and Seri Bintang. As for landed residential unit developments, there are Karyawan, Dinar, Nilam I, Nilam II Budiman, Emas, Bayu, Pendita, Nuri, Safira. \n#### Staying in Subang Bestari\n\nThe surroundings of the development are laid back and relaxed. Generally, the units for sale are suitable for different categories of home seekers. On the other hand, the investors also target the rental markets as they see a strong interest in young working adult or college and university students looking for a suitable unit for rent around the area.\n\n## Common facilities\n\nImage: parking-oParking  | Image: asterisk-oPerimeter Fencing\nImage: playground-oPlayground  | Image: asterisk-oRecreation Lake\nImage: pray-oSurau - Male & Female\n\n* * *\n\n* * *\n\n## Building details\n\nBuilding  | # Floors  | # Units\n--- | --- | ---\nBuilding 1 @ Jalan Nova U5/63, Subang Bestari, Subang, Selangor, Malaysia, 40150  | N/A  | 120\n